  "question": {
    "text": "$\\frac{d^2 x}{d y^2}$ equals",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "02Mqa",
      "text": "\n$\\left(\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\\right)^{-1}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "SRh4u",
      "text": "\n$-\\left(\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\\right)^{-1}\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jaRiW",
      "text": "\n$\\left(\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nKHN8",
      "text": "\n$-\\left(\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Rightarrow \\quad \\frac{d}{d y}\\left(\\frac{d x}{d y}\\right) & =\\frac{d}{d x}\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-1} \\frac{d x}{d y} \\\\\n\\frac{d^2 x}{d y^2} & =-\\left(\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-2}\\left(\\frac{d x}{d y}\\right) \\\\\n& =-\\left(\\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^{-3}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
